      },
      "message": "fix(gate): run the heavy lanes that a diff reaches (gate heavy)\n\n`cargo xtask gate heavy [--base main]` maps the diff to the release\n`--ignored` heavy lanes that it reaches, also through the dependencies\nbetween our crates (read from crates/*/Cargo.toml), and runs only those.\nA change in motion reaches the app heavy lanes. A changed suite reaches\nits own heavy binary. The steps are the release tier's heavy steps.\n\nAGENTS.md gets the rule \"Heavy lanes at review\"; the gate and work-issue\nskills and the PR-reviewer agent get the matching steps.\n\nPinned by xtask/src/heavy_plan_tests.rs.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nFixes #2568\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
